{
  "uid": "feedbackloop-saude",
  "title": "FeedbackLoop — Saúde do deployment",
  "tags": [
    "feedbackloop",
    "etapa-2"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Fonte (Prometheus)",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "refresh": 1,
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "ambiente",
        "label": "Ambiente",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(feedbackloop_analises_total, ambiente)",
          "refId": "ambientes"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**FeedbackLoop — saúde do deployment.** As caixas coloridas do topo usam a janela de tempo escolhida (canto superior direito): verde = dentro da meta, amarelo = atenção, vermelho = acima do limite. Limiares e justificativas: `docs/observabilidade/metricas-e-alertas.md`. Qualquer número deste painel só vale para o(s) ambiente(s) selecionado(s) em **ambiente**. Nenhuma métrica contém texto de respostas ou dado pessoal."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Volume: análises",
      "description": "Análises executadas na janela (ok + parcial + erro).",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(feedbackloop_analises_total{ambiente=~\"$ambiente\"}[$__range]))",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "sem dados",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Latência p50 (s)",
      "description": "Mediana da duração da análise completa. Meta: até 8 s.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 4,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (increase(feedbackloop_analise_duracao_seconds_bucket{ambiente=~\"$ambiente\"}[$__range])))",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 1,
          "noValue": "sem dados",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 8
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 15
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
